00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,620
(Howard:)I love Neil Diamond.

2
00:00:05,592 --> 00:00:09,232
J' (SINGING NEIL DIAMOND'S
"SWEET CAROLINE") J'

3
00:00:21,308 --> 00:00:23,548
(Raj:)Oh, hey, thanks for letting me
use the comic book store

4
00:00:23,711 --> 00:00:25,621
(Raj:)-as part of the scavenger hunt.
-Oh, my pleasure.

5
00:00:25,779 --> 00:00:27,589
(Stuart:)Always happy to help out
with fun things

6
00:00:27,748 --> 00:00:30,158
(Stuart:)that I wasn't invited
to be a part of.

7
00:00:30,317 --> 00:00:34,227
(Raj:)Oh, congratulations.
You're the first team to arrive.

8
00:00:34,388 --> 00:00:36,928
Yes! It's not a ruse
to make fun of me!

9
00:00:37,091 --> 00:00:39,661
It's a real game and I'm winning it!

10
00:00:41,328 --> 00:00:44,568
(Raj:)Your next puzzle is a riddle.

11
00:00:44,731 --> 00:00:48,681
(Raj:)And who better to give it to you
than The Riddler?

12
00:00:50,104 --> 00:00:54,074
(Bernadette:)Go, go, go, go, go, go, go, go,
go, go, go, go, go, go, go!

13
00:00:54,241 --> 00:00:55,841
(Bernadette:)How am I faster than you?

14
00:00:56,009 --> 00:00:59,119
(Bernadette:)I'm in heels and I stopped
to take a phone call.

